# Netlify — copy this file to the PUBLISH ROOT (same folder as your main index.html).
# Rules are evaluated top → bottom. Put /confirm BEFORE any SPA catch-all.
# Query strings (?code=…) and hashes (#access_token…) are preserved on 200 rewrites.

/confirm           /confirm/index.html      200!
/confirm/          /confirm/index.html      200!
/auth/confirm      /auth-confirm/index.html 200!
/auth/confirm/     /auth-confirm/index.html 200!

# If this file is your ONLY redirects config for an SPA site, uncomment the next line
# (must be LAST). If you already define /* → index.html in netlify.toml, skip this.
# /*               /index.html              200
